  <h1>Haskell vs Rust: two answers to the same question</h1>
  <div class="artmeta"><span>By Coldwast</span><span>Updated Nov 19, 2026</span><span>12 min read</span><span class="tag">#haskell</span><span class="tag">#rust</span><span class="tag">#types</span></div>
  <nav class="toc" id="toc"></nav>
  <figure>
    <img class="hero" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/17342282/pexels-photo-17342282.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200" alt="Two dirt tracks diverging across a meadow under an overcast sky" width="1200" height="420" loading="eager" />
